WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Here we are on day 1 of our fast, our 10-day fast, which will conclude on the 23rd of this month, Pentecost Sunday.

2
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
So once again, we encourage you to support us. Look back at the midweeks, we have provided all the information on why we fast, how we fast, and what we fast for.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:40.000
But what I am going to do now is that each day this week, each day of these 10 days, we are going to try to learn a little video about the fast and what we believe God is doing in us during the fast.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:57.000
So at the end of the midweek on Wednesday, it was concluded. It was just three extra minutes in which I was still talking about another thing that I believe the Lord wants to do in our hearts during these 10 days.

5
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:14.000
And it has to do with the recognition of the Bride and the Bridegroom. I have already mentioned this in the first midweek about the fast, about Matthew 9, where the Pharisees ask Jesus why his disciples do not fast.

6
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:33.000
And Jesus gives the answer that while the Bridegroom is with them, they have no reason to fast. And so, first and foremost, he gives himself the name of the Bridegroom in relation to fasting, in relation to that image of tomorrow.

7
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:54.000
So he says, they do not need to fast while I am with them, because I am with them. So that gives you a key to why the New Covenant Church, you and I, are going to fast. Because then he says, when the Son of Man returns, when he goes to the Father, then my disciples will fast for me.

8
00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:17.000
So I have learned in the counsel of the Church, blessed are those who mourn, for they will be comforted. And this idea of fasting, mourning, is this idea of longing for Jesus, longing for him to come, longing for his closeness, ultimately longing for us to be one.

9
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:36.000
That one day, at the end of the book, Jesus comes to be with us forever. That the Father comes and lives and dwells with his people forever. This is the whole story, people, this is what it is all about, this is the end of the book.

10
00:02:36.000 --> 00:03:02.000
So I had a dream, from Monday to Tuesday this week, and it was all about, without going into the details, it was about a woman, a bride and a bridegroom, and it was about intimacy, it was about desire, it was about face-to-face contact, it was about speaking words to each other, with intimate attention.

11
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:20.000
And I take it immediately as the Lord giving insight into part of why this fast is happening, a big part of it is, for us, his bride, that we get that story, that we truly are the bride of the Bridegroom, Christ.

12
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:29.000
And that in this season of life that we have, we are preparing to meet fully with our Bridegroom.

13
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:50.000
Now, in Revelation 19 you see that there is, the people rejoice, for Babylon has been overthrown and then it says that the wedding of the Bride has come and the Bride has made herself ready.

14
00:03:51.000 --> 00:04:08.000
So this frightens me, this dream frightens me, I was sharing it last week from Matthew 9 and I read those verses from Revelation 19, because the Lord gives us insight that it really is a time of preparation.

15
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:20.000
All of life is a time of preparation to meet the Lord, that is how we are, the Scripture speaks about Christians needing to live their lives in readiness, we do not know when he comes, but he comes and we truly believe it.

16
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:25.000
And I believe that this is even part of the purification, for some of us we really need to believe that.

17
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Do we truly promise by faith that Jesus is coming, that Jesus is really coming in the clouds with all his Saints and he will have his prepared pure bride?

18
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:46.000
Do we promise that as a church or do we think it is just a story?

19
00:04:47.000 --> 00:05:05.000
And I believe that this is part of why the Lord asks us to have a verse, that in these days, and this is what I want to give you, let this be part of the intention, let this be part of what you ask the Holy Spirit to work in you and to purify your faith,

20
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:24.000
that you truly believe that Jesus is coming back, that we really believe that with our whole heart, that we are truly living in preparation for that day and that means pure heart, pure spirit, pure mind,

21
00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:41.000
So I believe that part of that dream of mine was to connect it with this time of the 10-day fast, to share that with us, to say, hey, the Lord, he is a Lord, he goes before us, he has things to declare to us, to speak to us in these 10 days,

22
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:49.000
he wants to do a work in some of us, to truly believe that this is what life is all about, that the end of the book is that Jesus is coming,

23
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:59.000
and he comes for a person who waited for him, who was beloved to him, who was like a bride for him, who has hidden themselves,

24
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:06.000
who have hidden this world, hidden other things and other lovers and other changes,

25
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:13.000
and we have said, we have set our hearts on the man, Jesus, we have set our hearts on him, we have heard him, we have believed him,

26
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:22.000
and then we meet, and there is this joy of this match, there is a joy, and we are happy that we are finally together,

27
00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:32.000
forever, and there is no separation, so I just want to share that story, let that be part of your fast,

28
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:37.000
ask the Holy Spirit, give me faith to read these scriptures and to believe them,

29
00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:44.000
the Holy Spirit helps me to see things I have never seen, hidden my life from the Lord,

30
00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:50.000
and I mean a joy for us, a joy of waiting for more of him in our lives,

31
00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:57.000
and so I believe that you today with that, read some of the scriptures about that,

32
00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.000
and stay joyful, and we will see you tomorrow.
